OL,3,GNEWSAMyeloma patient's 'amazing'
OL,4,Aimmunotherapy recovery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was being prepared for
OL,7,Fend-of-life care has shocked doctors,
OL,8,Fafter responding to a groundbreaking
OL,9,Fnew treatment for blood cancer.
OL,11,FJohn Kingsley, 80, from Bewdley,
OL,12,FWorcestershire, was given just six
OL,13,Fweeks to live when he suffered a
OL,14,Fpneumonia infection in May 2025 while
OL,15,Fundergoing treatment for myeloma, which
OL,16,Faffects bone marrow.
OL,18,FBut against all the odds, John
OL,19,Fexperienced a remarkable recovery and
OL,20,Fis still enjoying life 18 months later
OL,21,Fafter undergoing immunotherapy
OL,22,Ftreatment.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
