OL,3,GNEWSAMyeloma patient's 'amazing'
OL,4,Aimmunotherapy recovery
OL,5,
OL,6,FConsultant haematologist Salim Shafeek
OL,7,Fsaid: "In my 30-year career I've never
OL,8,Fseen anyone come through the condition
OL,9,Fhe was in and keep going. His
OL,10,Fdetermination is amazing."
